event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":85,"item_id":"rs_0e5715ccf1ae2c3e016aca7e910ae48196874028bf7dc4209b","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating migration testing**\n\nI'm considering whether I need to separate the migration tests for actual legacy rows. It seems like having a second test would be best to avoid breaking anything with empty entries in the initial legacy tasks. I could create a standalone test for migration that’s easier to manage. Also, extending existing tasks and prioritizing them might be a good idea to ensure everything goes smoothly. There are many factors to keep in mind!"}

